    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d127-a7">

                <pb facs="0236" n="130" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg130"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7 in No.
                    164.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Termination of safe-conduct</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In virtue of the power conferred upon us in the safe-conduct conceded under date
                    of 2d of present month, the undersigned have the honor to communicate to his
                    excellency the Hon. R. Cruzat, minister of foreign affairs of Chile, that they
                    fix the day of the 15th of May instant, at 12 o’clock at night, as the time when
                    said guaranty shall cease.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Patrick Egan</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. B. Cavalcanti de
                                Lacerda</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. De France</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
